&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Strong technical fluency, comfortable partnering with engineering leadership on architecture, sequencing, and implementation tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills, with comfort presenting to and influencing executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
