&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Willingness and ability to travel regularly within Europe and support team development across multiple hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;A cost-efficient, scrappy mindset, as Proton is bootstrapped and wins through smart execution rather than big budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and a willingness to make bold, high-conviction calls about where a product should go next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
