&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A creative IT professional with hands-on experience in system administration on multiple platforms. A builder trying to tackle challenges rapidly and with limited resources using creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
