&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Hands-on system administration experience on Linux and preferably another OS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Proton is an office-first company. We expect you to spend most of your time in the office, and while we do offer some flexibility to work from home, we believe in-person collaboration helps us build the best products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
