&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1257&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0169d31d7b24&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt; at Proton, we all have the opportunity to be owners of the company. From day one, you have a real stake in what we&#39;re building. When Proton wins, you win.&lt;/p&gt;
