&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1791&quot; data-local-id=&quot;df097238bccb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with security analysts, backend/frontend engineers, and customer support to align technical solutions with user needs.&lt;/p&gt;
