&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2149&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f126d2878b4e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Degree in Computer Science&lt;/strong&gt; or a related quantitative field, with 2+ years hands-on experience in building and running ML systems.&lt;/p&gt;
