&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2383&quot; data-local-id=&quot;47e02097efb5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience with LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; in agentic environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2441&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6de294efff48&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong software engineering skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Proficiency in Python, with a solid understanding of backend and server fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;
