&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2566&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e8233c7ab70&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Statistical rigor&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of probability, hypothesis testing, and experimental design.&lt;/p&gt;
