&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6000724f4a3a&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;adversarial ML&lt;/strong&gt; or red-teaming ML systems.&lt;/p&gt;
