&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2751&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27b5fb730b01&quot;&gt;Experience working on &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2797&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c6c7acddda3c&quot;&gt;Contributions to &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;open-source security/privacy tools&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
