&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2853&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eeb763d63a94&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;federated learning&lt;/strong&gt;, differential privacy, or on-device inference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
