&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Salary Range : Paris - &lt;/strong&gt;Base Annual Gross - 51,000€ to 76,000€ - Final compensation will be determined based on the candidate&#39;s qualifications, skills, and previous experience.&lt;/li&gt;
