&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1968&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e87c3e2586e1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office First:&lt;/strong&gt; Proton is an office-first company. We expect you to spend most of your time in the office, and while we do offer some flexibility to work from home, we believe in-person collaboration helps us build the best products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2276&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f36861ba7cfd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt; Lunch and snacks are on us every day in our offices so you can focus on the work and not on what&#39;s for lunch.&lt;/p&gt;
